    "HD5-A04": "SUPPORTS evaluator/lifecycle separation and NARROWS S7: strong population efficacy can coexist with catastrophic lot-manufacturing failure. Cutter invalidates a production-safety evaluator, not the biological intervention class.",
    "HD5-A05": "SUPPORTS S2/S3/S4/S8 while leaving S5/S6/S9 N/A: a broad directional hypothesis can remain rationally low-tractability until ocean-floor observation creates discriminating tests.",
    "HD5-A07": "SUPPORTS whole-system conditional selection: lunar-orbit rendezvous can dominate a more direct architecture because mass, launch, deadline and staged verification change the world; architectural indirectness is not overhead by itself.",
